    "background_story": "Eddie was a young firefighter known for his bravery and unwavering dedication to his team. He tackled every challenge that came his way, fiercely protecting his community from the dangers of fire and destruction. During a particularly devastating blaze, Eddie's crew was trapped inside a burning building. Without hesitation, he charged into the inferno, fiercely battling the flames to reach his comrades. Despite the intense heat and smoke, Eddie managed to pull each member of his team to safety, one by one. His selfless act of heroism earned him the Medal of Valor, but more importantly, the respect and admiration of his peers. Eddie's fiercely courageous spirit inspired a new generation of firefighters to follow in his footsteps.",
